sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant AuthController
    participant Middleware
    participant Database
    participant Dashboard

    Note over User,Dashboard: Authentication Flow

    %% Registration
    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
        Note right of User: Registration Process
        User->>Browser: Access /register
        Browser->>AuthController: GET register
        AuthController-->>Browser: Show registration form
        User->>Browser: Fill form & submit
        Browser->>AuthController: POST register
        AuthController->>Database: Create user (role: student)
        Database-->>AuthController: User created
        AuthController->>AuthController: Auto login
        AuthController-->>Browser: Redirect to /dashboard
        Browser->>Middleware: Check role
        Middleware-->>Browser: Redirect to student.dashboard
    end

    %% Login
    rect rgb(255, 220, 200)
        Note right of User: Login Process
        User->>Browser: Access /login
        Browser->>AuthController: GET login
        AuthController-->>Browser: Show login form
        User->>Browser: Enter credentials
        Browser->>AuthController: POST login
        AuthController->>Database: Verify credentials
        Database-->>AuthController: User authenticated
        AuthController->>AuthController: Create session
        AuthController-->>Browser: Redirect to /dashboard
        Browser->>Middleware: Check user role
        
        alt Role: Admin
            Middleware-->>Dashboard: Redirect to admin dashboard
        else Role: Committee
            Middleware-->>Dashboard: Redirect to committee dashboard
        else Role: Student
            Middleware-->>Dashboard: Redirect to student dashboard
        end
    end

    %% Logout
    rect rgb(220, 255, 200)
        Note right of User: Logout Process
        User->>Browser: Click logout
        Browser->>AuthController: POST logout
        AuthController->>AuthController: Destroy session
        AuthController->>AuthController: Invalidate token
        AuthController-->>Browser: Redirect to home
        Browser-->>User: Show homepage
    end
